openjpeg-1.3.6: the decoder of @cornerstonejs/codec-openjpeg 1.3.6
(dist/openjpegwasm_decode.js and dist/openjpegwasm_decode.wasm, unchanged but
for one line appended to the .js -- `export default OpenJPEGWASM;` -- which
makes it an ES module; saved as openjpegwasm_decode.mjs). Used by the website's
Python worker to decode JPEG 2000 for tifffile (plexora/browser/imagecodecs_shim.py).

sha256 of the published files:
  openjpegwasm_decode.wasm  5aff4e65444480a40289... (as published)
  openjpegwasm_decode.js    8e6d4ea409ed817ee08a... (before the appended line)

